# Copy this file to .env.local (same folder) and fill in your key(s).
# Get a free Groq key at https://console.groq.com/keys
#
# This powers app/api/ai/route.ts -- AI topic explanation, AI-generated
# graph expansion, the chat panel, and both sides of both debate
# features (see MODEL / MODEL_AGAINST in route.ts -- the "for" and
# "against" debate voices are now two different Groq models on this
# same key, not two providers). The key is only ever read server-side
# (inside the Next.js route handler); it is never sent to the browser.
# Without it, everything else in the app still works (Wikipedia
# expansion, the 3D graph, search) -- only the "Explain with AI" /
# "Expand with AI" / chat / debate features will show an error.

GROQ_API_KEY=your_key_here

# Get a free key at https://app.tavily.com (1,000 free searches/month,
# no card required)
#
# Powers "Around the web" / "Videos" in the InfoPanel. Without it, that
# section just shows plain "search the web for this" / "search YouTube
# for this" links instead of live results -- everything else in the
# app works the same either way.

TAVILY_API_KEY=your_key_here
